==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|mynt}}, probably via {{etyl|ang|is}} {{m|ang|mynet}}, ultimately from {{etyl|la|is}} {{m|la|monēta}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/mɪn̥t/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ɪn̥t|lang=is}}
*: {{homophones|minnt|mynnt|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|f|myntar|myntir}}

# a [[coin]]{{jump|is|coin|s}}
# a [[currency]]{{jump|is|currency|s}}

====Declension====
{{is-decl-noun-f-s2|m|y|nt}}

====Derived terms====
* [[Efnahags- og myntbandalagið]] (Economic and Monetary Union)
